Opera is the fifth most used web {{glossary(“browser”)}}, publicly released in 1996 and initially running on Windows only. 
Opera uses {{glossary(“Blink”)}} as its layout engine since 2013 (before that, {{glossary(“Presto”)}}). 
Opera also exists in mobile and tablet versions. 
